<div id="cc-matrix-5646417796"><div id="cc-m-18327628296" class="j-module n j-textWithImage "><figure class="cc-imagewrapper cc-m-image-align-2">
<img srcset="https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=237x1024:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/i1e692d081ee1270f/version/1695018455/image.jpg 237w, https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/none/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/i1e692d081ee1270f/version/1695018455/image.jpg 293w" sizes="(min-width: 237px) 237px, 100vw" id="cc-m-textwithimage-image-18327628296" src="https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=237x1024:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/i1e692d081ee1270f/version/1695018455/image.jpg" alt="" class="" data-src-width="293" data-src-height="112" data-src="https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=237x1024:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/i1e692d081ee1270f/version/1695018455/image.jpg" data-image-id="10701095696"/>    

</figure>
<div>
    <div id="cc-m-textwithimage-18327628296" data-name="text" data-action="text" class="cc-m-textwithimage-inline-rte">
        <p>
    <strong>Det blev til 2 artikler p&#xE5; CleanTechnica i&#xA0;september hvor vi skal gense den legendariske Tesla Roadster</strong>
</p>    </div>
</div>

<div class="cc-clear"></div>
<script id="cc-m-reg-18327628296">// 
</script></div><div id="cc-m-18327628396" class="j-module n j-text "><p>
    &#xA0;
</p>

<p>
    Den eneste ene
