      <link>https://www.lifelike.dk/2023/04/05/tesla-indtager-danmark/</link>
      <guid>https://www.lifelike.dk/2023/04/05/tesla-indtager-danmark/</guid>
      <description><![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0"?>
<div id="cc-matrix-5631944896"><div id="cc-m-18256502396" class="j-module n j-textWithImage "><figure class="cc-imagewrapper cc-m-image-align-2">
<img srcset="https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=236x1024:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/i5b1442b1e9c41272/version/1680726721/image.jpg 236w, https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=320x1024:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/i5b1442b1e9c41272/version/1680726721/image.jpg 320w, https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=472x1024:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/i5b1442b1e9c41272/version/1680726721/image.jpg 472w" sizes="(min-width: 236px) 236px, 100vw" id="cc-m-textwithimage-image-18256502396" src="https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=236x1024:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/i5b1442b1e9c41272/version/1680726721/image.jpg" alt="" class="" data-src-width="2102" data-src-height="1105" data-src="https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=236x1024:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/i5b1442b1e9c41272/version/1680726721/image.jpg" data-image-id="10645489596"/>    

</figure>
<div>
    <div id="cc-m-textwithimage-18256502396" data-name="text" data-action="text" class="cc-m-textwithimage-inline-rte">
        <p>
    <strong>For et &#xE5;r siden&#xA0;rullede de f&#xF8;rste Tesla biler produceret i Europa ud af en stor fabrik i Berlin.&#xA0;Mange af dem havner i Danmark. Rigtig mange.</strong>
</p>    </div>
</div>

<div class="cc-clear"></div>
<script id="cc-m-reg-18256502396">// 
</script></div><div id="cc-m-18256502496" class="j-module n j-text "><p>
    &#xA0;
</p>

<p>
    Tesla vil bygge 20 millioner biler pr. &#xE5;r fra 2030. Lyder det tosset? S&#xE5; t&#xE6;nk p&#xE5; at de i &#xE5;r vil bygge ca. 2 millioner, og at de i 2020 byggede 500.000. Og s&#xE5; er de ikke engang begyndt at bygge
    deres billige model endnu...
</p>

<p>
    &#xA0;
</p>

<p>
    Jeg skrev for et &#xE5;r siden: "Jo, men hvorfor skal en Tesla v&#xE6;re S&#xC5; dyr? Fordi det ikke er rimeligt at lade kunder vente i over et &#xE5;r. Det er indtil videre KUN derfor. Hvad ville du selv g&#xF8;re, hvis
    dit produkt var s&#xE5; eftertragtet?"
</p>

<p>
    &#xA0;
</p>

<p>
    Nu har Berlin-fabrikken s&#xE5; rundet 5000 enheder pr. uge. Texas-fabrikken har rundet 4000 pr. uge. S&#xE5; Tesla har valgt at s&#xE6;tte priserne voldsomt ned, og det har resulteret i det du ser fra Danske
    Bilimport&#xF8;rers statistik herunder. Hvem skulle have troet det? Tesla sl&#xE5;r VW. Det er sandelig nye tider.
</p>

<p>
    &#xA0;
</p>

<p>
    Tesla Model Y er nu den bedst s&#xE6;lgende bil i Danmark i f&#xF8;rste kvartal 2023 med 4702 enheder. Peugeot 208 ligger p&#xE5; en fjern andenplads med 1773 enheder.
</p>

<p>
    &#xA0;
</p>

<p>
    N&#xE6;ste &#xE5;r ruller de f&#xF8;rste af den billige model ud fra den enorme nye fabrik der bygges i Mexico, og rygtet siger at Berlin og Shanghai vil bygge den samme model kort tid efter. Dette er kun
    begyndelsen...
</p></div><div id="cc-m-18256503396" class="j-module n j-imageSubtitle "><figure class="cc-imagewrapper cc-m-image-align-1 cc-m-width-maxed">
<img srcset="https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=320x10000:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/id9d78400f4393c72/version/1680726840/image.jpg 320w, https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=640x10000:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/id9d78400f4393c72/version/1680726840/image.jpg 640w, https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=960x10000:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/id9d78400f4393c72/version/1680726840/image.jpg 960w, https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=983x10000:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/id9d78400f4393c72/version/1680726840/image.jpg 983w, https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=1280x10000:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/id9d78400f4393c72/version/1680726840/image.jpg 1280w, https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/none/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/id9d78400f4393c72/version/1680726840/image.jpg 1728w" sizes="(min-width: 983px) 983px, 100vw" id="cc-m-imagesubtitle-image-18256503396" src="https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=983x10000:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/id9d78400f4393c72/version/1680726840/image.jpg" alt="" class="" data-src-width="1728" data-src-height="728" data-src="https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=983x10000:format=jpg/path/s30b00695b2b3644c/image/id9d78400f4393c72/version/1680726840/image.jpg" data-image-id="10645489796"/>    

